  {
   "step": "原因 / 做法第 1、3 步",
   "fact": "Navigation 的 customNavContentTransition 回调返回 undefined 时执行默认转场动效；返回 NavigationAnimatedTransition 时按其中的 transition 回调执行自定义转场",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-navigation.md，customNavContentTransition",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "新查"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "NavigationAnimatedTransition.timeout 单位为毫秒：不可交互的自定义转场不设时 1000ms 后由系统自动结束；可交互转场默认没有超时，不设 timeout 时要调用 finishTransition 才结束本次转场",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-navigation.md，NavigationAnimatedTransition",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "新查"
  }
